--- D. A STEP ONLY EVER SLOWS. An event 1 day out has a 30-min band; 5,617 GA tickets
---    must not hold it at 4 hours... it must take the SLOWER of the two, which is 4h.
---    And inside the last day the days-out band is what matters for a fast-moving event:
---    greatest() is what guarantees the GA step never speeds anything up.
 day_out_no_ga | day_out_deep_ga | far_out_deep_ga | far_out_no_ga 
